\ Not supported (Forth review of small-tactics-1, finding 2, and its
\ re-check, finding 1): an iterate whose weight (its count and 2) with the
\ proof's by (4) passes the runner's bound on Lean's recursion depth
\ (tactic-run.fs's lf-tac-depth-most, 240): 99 at by-iterate. Pinned Lean
\ accepts counts up to 251 here (252: "maximum recursion depth has been
\ reached"; src/front/tactics/iterate.fs has the measures).
\ Lean: theorem u_it_deep (a b : Nat) (h : a = b) : a = b := by
\         iterate 235 skip
\         exact h
theorem u_it_deep
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b = explicit: h  a b =
:= by
  235 by-iterate by-skip by-end
  ' h by-exact
end u_it_deep
